<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Artistas — SIDE B</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/variables.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/global.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/components.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/home.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/artists.css?v=4"></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido</a><header class="site-header"></header><main id="contenido"><section class="artists-hero container"><p class="eyebrow">Nuevas coordenadas</p><h1>Descubre<br><em>algo distinto.</em></h1><p>Artistas que están haciendo ruido en los márgenes. Sin algoritmos, con criterio.</p></section><section class="container"><div class="artists-grid"><?php if($error):?><p class="profile-note"><?=e($error)?></p><?php elseif(!$artists):?><p class="profile-note">Aún no hay artistas disponibles.</p><?php endif;?><?php foreach($artists as $artist):$slug=artist_slug($artist['nombre']);?><article class="artist-card"><a class="artist-art" href="artista.php?artista=<?=rawurlencode($slug)?>" aria-label="Ver perfil de <?=e($artist['nombre'])?>"><?php if($artist['imagen']):?><img src="<?=e($artist['imagen'])?>" alt="<?=e($artist['nombre'])?>"><?php endif;?></a><h2><a href="artista.php?artista=<?=rawurlencode($slug)?>"><?=e($artist['nombre'])?></a></h2><?php if($artist['genero']):?><p><?=e($artist['genero'])?></p><?php endif;?></article><?php endforeach;?></div></section></main><?=sideb_footer()?></body></html>
